# Runtime data dir + user store — bcrypt hashes, TOTP/MFA seeds, sessions, audit
# log. Default STORAGE_ROOT is ./data, so a local `go run` in backend/ creates
# backend/data/users.json. This repo is public — never commit any of it.
data/
backend/data/
users.json

# Internal working docs — the six-doc "bible" + legacy dev logs. NEVER commit
# these to a PUBLIC repo: they carry deploy/infra detail, in-flight notes, and
# security analysis. They live locally only (backed up via the C:\Dev backup).
/OrientationMap.md
/NavigationMap.md
/CodeMap.md
/CODE-MAP.md
/KnowledgeBase.md
/ResearchJournal.md
/ToDo.md
/Testing.md
/FEATURES.md
/IMPROVEMENTS.md
